    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_e7911305",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Mysogynous; overall-intent-description: The meme depicts a man in a pink turban holding a drink, with text that reads 'when she calls you a 40sec man' and 'but she paid own bride price to marry you.' The visual of the man, combined with the text, is used to mock or belittle a man's perceived inadequacy in romantic or sexual contexts, while also implying that his worth is tied to financial compensation (bride price). This framing is misogynistic as it reduces a woman's agency and value to transactional or financial terms, and it reinforces harmful stereotypes about gender roles and relationships. The meme uses the juxtaposition of the man's confident pose with the derogatory text to create a humorous but demeaning portrayal of male inadequacy, which is a form of misogynistic humor that devalues women's autonomy and reinforces patriarchal norms.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_46b31617"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
