      "instance_name": "arrogant_confidence",
      "label": "arrogant confidence expression",
      "description": "The man is smiling broadly and holding a drink in a relaxed, self-assured pose, suggesting he is confident and possibly mocking the situation described in the text. His expression and body language convey a sense of self-satisfaction or bravado, which contrasts with the derogatory text about being called a '40sec man'.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
